    new "Sarah si maledisse."

    old "Stupid."
    new "Stupida."

    old "She should have explored the alley when she still had time. When it was still safe."
    new "Avrebbe dovuto esplorare il vicolo quando aveva ancora tempo. Quando era ancora al sicuro."

    old "Not while she was naked and on the run."
